# Keep line endings LF everywhere: in the repository and in every checkout.
# The CI lint/test/build matrix includes windows-latest, where Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true and would otherwise hand the runner CRLF files.
# Biome formats to LF (matching .editorconfig), so a CRLF checkout would make
# `biome check .` report every line of every file as a formatting difference.
* text=auto eol=lf
